{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n  <body>\n    <p>對於熱衷於 CrossFit、HIIT 或功能性訓練的您，WOD Timer 這款專業級間歇訓練計時器絕對是不可或缺的智能夥伴，它能為您的每次鍛鍊帶來前所未有的精準與效率，現正限時免費中，千萬別錯過這個提升訓練品質的絕佳機會。</p>\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/460x460bb-75-35.webp\" alt=\"限時免費\">\n    <h2>全面支援主流健身訓練模式</h2>\n    <p>WOD Timer 內建 Tabata、EMOM、AMRAP 及 For Time 等多種經典間歇訓練計時模式，讓您根據需求輕鬆設定工作與休息時間，提供清晰的語音或音效提示。同時，它完美整合 Apple Watch 與 HealthKit，您可直接從手腕控制訓練，即時監測心率，並自動記錄卡路里消耗與運動時長，所有訓練數據更透過 iCloud 同步，確保您的訓練規劃與歷史記錄萬無一失。</p>\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1206x2622bb-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"App Screenshot\">\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1206x2622bb-1-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"App Screenshot\">\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1206x2622bb-2-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"App Screenshot\">\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1206x2622bb-3-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"App Screenshot\">\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1206x2622bb-4-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"App Screenshot\">\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1206x2622bb-5-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"App Screenshot\">\n    <ul>\n      <li>應用名稱：WOD Timer: Workout Timer Pro</li>\n      <li>應用類別：Sports</li>\n      <li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n    </ul>\n  </body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-07T20:44:55.572697+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":381,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}